    "enUS": {
      "description": "Serving the Horde in one of the great battles against the Alliance is a source of great honor!  The few however, that have served the Horde in ALL of our active battlefronts are our truly great fighters.  We shall vanquish our opponents, not by fighting isolated skirmishes, but by waging a well-coordinated war.\n\nGo forth and crush the Alliance in Arathi Basin, Alterac Valley and Warsong Gulch!  For Honor!  For the Horde!",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor: {current}/{required}",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Arathi Basin Mark of Honor: {current}/{required}",
          "type": "item"
        },
